(Howard:)The day she left for Florida.

4
00:00:07,788 --> 00:00:10,588
(Howard:)She asked me to drive her
to the airport.

5
00:00:12,860 --> 00:00:14,960
I-I was too busy.

6
00:00:14,962 --> 00:00:16,662
(Amy:)And...

7
00:00:16,663 --> 00:00:20,233
(Howard:)I made her take a cab.

8
00:00:21,969 --> 00:00:24,699
(Howard:)I was too busy.

9
00:00:24,705 --> 00:00:27,405
(Bernadette:)There's no way
you could've known.

10
00:00:29,777 --> 00:00:31,277
(Bernadette:)Be right back.

11
00:00:34,248 --> 00:00:36,148
(Bernadette:)Excuse me?

12
00:00:36,150 --> 00:00:37,450
(Sheldon:)Yes?

13
00:00:39,019 --> 00:00:40,849
(Bernadette:)You better find
my husband's mother

14
00:00:40,854 --> 00:00:42,324
(Bernadette:)'cause one way or another,

15
00:00:42,322 --> 00:00:45,622
we're walking out of this
airport with a dead woman!

16
00:00:49,229 --> 00:00:50,529
(moaning)

17
00:00:50,531 --> 00:00:52,461
(Leonard:)Which book are we looking for?
Uh...

18
00:00:52,466 --> 00:00:54,196
Origin of Species.

19
00:00:54,201 --> 00:00:56,371
(Leonard:)Here it is.

20
00:00:56,370 --> 00:00:57,440
(Leonard:)There's a black light.

21
00:00:57,437 --> 00:01:00,027
(Emily:)Oh, hang on.
(zombie moaning)

